{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "A Night at the Planetarium"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Not Just Science Fiction"}, {"type": "position", "content": 10}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 1}, {"type": "level", "content": "B2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Understand detailed descriptions of real or imaginary events and experiences in present, past or future, in spoken interactions or written texts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex texts on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex texts on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex texts on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex texts on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex texts on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex texts on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex texts on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex texts on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "in a heartbeat "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " to do something very quickly, without  thinking about it"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: If I were in your shoes, I would cancel in a heartbeat."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le01ob10aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to talk about leisure."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "alibi "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an excuse for something bad or a failure"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: You're my alibi if I ever need one."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le01ob10aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "plan "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a set of arrangements for the future "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Man, if I didn't have plans, I would come over and watch it."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le01ob10aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "temptation"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " the \u200bwish to do or have something that you \u200bknow you should not do or have  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I can't resist the temptation of Star Wars."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le01ob10aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "excuse"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a \u200breason that you give to \u200bexplain why you did something \u200bwrong "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun):"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: Ah well, come on! Just give her a better excuse."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le01ob10aud05"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Must</span>, <span class=\"italic\">May</span>, <span class=\"italic\">Might</span>, <span class=\"italic\">Could</span> and <span class=\"italic\">Can't</span> to Speculate about the Present"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "If you want to make guesses about something in the present, you can use special modal verbs like <span class=\"italic\">must, may, might, could</span> and <span class=\"italic\">can't</span>."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">must\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"+ base form of the verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">may/might/could\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"+ base form of the verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">can't\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"+ base form of the verb\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\"><span class=\"italic\">Must</span></span> means that you are almost certain about something. This is the best possible guess. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\"><span class=\"italic\">Can't</span></span> is the opposite of <span class=\"strong\"><span class=\"italic\">must</span></span> and means that you are almost certain that something is not happening or cannot happen."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\"><span class=\"italic\">May, might</span></span> and <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">could</span></span> all have the same meaning and you use them when you are less sure. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "You <span class=\"strong\">may</span> even discover a whole new passion! "}, {"type": "example", "content": "You <span class=\"strong\">must</span> cancel on her a lot"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I am sure you <span class=\"strong\">could</span> reschedule. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "It <span class=\"strong\">might</span> be one of the best movies you ever see in your life!"}, {"type": "example", "content": "She <span class=\"strong\">can't</span> get angry at you for that. "}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Real and Unreal Conditionals"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You sometimes need to talk about conditions and possible results or consequences that are real in the present. This is where you need to make a zero conditional sentence using an if-clause. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use a zero conditional sentence to talk about a general truth or something that happens habitually."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Grammar Structure:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">if</span> + simple present, simple present\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">simple present + <span class=\\\"strong\\\">if</span> + simple present\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Examples:<br><span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">If</span> I don't get enough sleep, I get sick.<br> I usually go to the beach <span class=\"strong\">if</span> the weather is nice."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The <span class=\"italic\">if</span>-clause is the condition clause and can come before or after the result clause. You need to put a comma after the <span class=\"italic\">if</span>-clause if it comes before the result clause."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Man, <span class=\"strong\">if</span> I <span class=\"strong\">didn't have</span> plans, I <span class=\"strong\">would</span> come over and watch it."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\"> If</span> you feel better, you <span class=\"strong\">wouldn't</span> cancel your plans with her. "}, {"type": "example", "content": " <span class=\"strong\">If</span> she <span class=\"strong\">calls</span> you, don't <span class=\"strong\">pick up</span> and tell her later you fell asleep."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn10le01ob10re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Watch the movie <span class=\"italic\">Star Wars</span> in English."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Turn the subtitles on for the first twenty minutes and then off for the next twenty minutes. Continue to alternate."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Discuss with a friend whether or not it is likely that we will live in a similar way to those characters in <span class=\"italic\">Star Wars</span> in the future."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I watch a movie about space."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I read the subtitles at times."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I express what is likely or unlikely."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn10le01ob10re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le01ob10re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn10le01ob10re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: That was some movie eh, Peter? I still haven't gotten it out of my mind.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I told you sci-fi movies are awesome! There are so many great ones out there as well. If you give sci-fi a chance now, you won't regret it. You may even discover a whole new passion!\n<br><span class=\"strong\">John</span>: I know. I'm planning on watching <span class=\"italic\">Star Wars</span> later on tonight. I heard it's one of the best movies of all time. It must be good!", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn10le01ob10re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: <span class=\"italic\">Star Wars</span> is amazing! Man, if I didn't have plans, I would come over and watch it.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">John</span>:  Really? Well cancel them. I am sure you could reschedule.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Well, that might be a problem. I'm meeting a girl, Amanda, tonight. If I don't show up, she will never talk to me again.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">John</span>: Wow. You must cancel on her a lot. Ah well, come on! Just give her a better excuse. If I were in your shoes, I would cancel in a heartbeat. Come on! It's <span class=\"italic\">Star Wars</span>! It might be one of the best movies you ever see in your life!", "id": 2, "time": "25500", "image": "engenn10le01ob10re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: You do realize how hard you are making it for me right now. Ah fine! Only because I can't resist the temptation of <span class=\"italic\">Star Wars</span>. What should I tell her?\n<br><span class=\"strong\">John</span>: Tell her that you feel sick and if you felt better, you wouldn't cancel your plans with her.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Okay, I like that. You're my alibi if I ever need one.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">John</span>: If she calls you, don't pick up and tell her later you fell asleep. She can't get angry at you for that.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: She will definitely believe that. Thanks John.", "id": 3, "time": "60000", "image": "engenn10le01ob10re2img05.jpg"}]}}]}], "exercises": [{"questions": [], "